  "description": "Lycia.Extensions.AspNetCore adds an opt-in ASP.NET Core Minimal API endpoint\n            (app.MapLyciaDiagnostics()) that exposes Lycia's resolved reliability/persistence topology -\n            delivery guarantee, persistence mode and provider, Split Store canonical/operational stores,\n            and Inbox/Outbox/journal/reconciliation capability flags - as a secret-free JSON diagnostics\n            projection over the existing ILyciaReliabilityDiagnostics snapshot. This is a configuration\n            endpoint, not a health check: it never probes RabbitMQ, Redis, PostgreSQL, SQL Server, Kafka or\n            NATS, and it maps no route unless the application explicitly calls MapLyciaDiagnostics().",
  "id": "Lycia.Extensions.AspNetCore",
